# Contact form delivery (Let's Connect section).
#
# 1. Sign in at https://formspree.io with bodasrisaiganeshan26@gmail.com and
#    verify that address when Formspree asks.
# 2. Create a new form. Its endpoint looks like https://formspree.io/f/abcd1234
# 3. Copy the ID after /f/ into a file named .env.local in this folder:
#
#      VITE_FORMSPREE_FORM_ID=abcd1234
#
#    (or set the same variable in your hosting provider's build settings).
# 4. Restart `npm run dev` / rebuild, then send one test message.
#
# The form ID is a public identifier, not a secret — it is safe in the built
# site. Never put a Formspree API key or any other secret in a VITE_ variable.
VITE_FORMSPREE_FORM_ID=
